1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,967
Ergo AI Desk
How the assessment works

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,967
Start an assessment
Tap "Mulai Asesmen" to begin.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:23,967
Answer the questionnaire
Fill sections A to D, then continue with "Next: unggah foto".

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,967
Capture the lateral view
Keypoint guidance shows "7 dari 7 keypoint hijau"; then take the photo.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,967
Capture the superior view
Keypoint guidance shows "6 dari 6 keypoint hijau"; then take the photo.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,967
Follow the keypoint guidance
Photo capture stays locked until all keypoints are green.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,967
Add follow-up answers
Answer each question "Ya" or "Tidak", then tap "Analisis dan lihat hasil".

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:05,967
Scroll through the results
Each line links two body points; the legend gives its status.

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,967
Review the summary
Keypoint connections are counted as sesuai, belum sesuai or tidak dapat dianalisis.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,967
Read the findings
Each finding shows its source photo, keypoint number and status.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,967
Interface mockup with simulated data
Phases shown
